1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:02,100
The Forbidden City only lets you walk one way.

2
00:00:02,200 --> 00:00:04,100
I'm your China Travel Expert.

3
00:00:04,200 --> 00:00:06,600
You go in at the south, through the Meridian Gate.

4
00:00:06,700 --> 00:00:09,000
From there it is one direction: south to north.

5
00:00:09,100 --> 00:00:11,400
You leave by the north gate — there is no walking back.

6
00:00:11,500 --> 00:00:13,300
★ Expert Tip: Jingshan Park sits right across the road.

7
00:00:13,400 --> 00:00:15,000
Climb Jingshan or head home — which would you pick?
